        "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>VİRGİNİA WOOLF</em><br><br></p>\n\n\n\n<div data-wp-interactive=\"core/file\" class=\"wp-block-file\"><object data-wp-bind--hidden=\"!state.hasPdfPreview\" hidden class=\"wp-block-file__embed\" data=\"https://bejingmedya.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Virginia-Woolf-Kendine-Ait-Bir-Oda.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\" style=\"width:100%;height:710px\" aria-label=\"PDF gömme\"></object><a href=\"https://bejingmedya.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Virginia-Woolf-Kendine-Ait-Bir-Oda.pdf\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>İndir</a></div>",
